 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Kawaii No Wa Ore De Aru"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "かわいいのは俺である"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Yuki, the visual representative of a famous dance influencer group with one million subscribers, had a problem. He could never maintain a relationship for long! He was immediately labeled as frivolous, suspected of cheating (even though he wasn’t), and dumped—over and over again. Even though he was dating them because he truly liked them…!\n\nOne day, at a drinking party, Yuki became intrigued by a reserved and elegant girl, Yurino, who was trying to leave early. Curious, he followed her out of the venue. Little did he know, this was the beginning of a never-ending spiral of romantic misfortunes.",
   "ja": "チャンネル登録者数100万人、有名ダンス系インフルエンサーグループのビジュ担当・ユキには悩みがあった。それは、彼女と全然長続きしないこと…！　即座にチャラ認定され浮気（※してない）を疑われて破局！ の繰り返し…。好きだから付き合ってるのに…！　そんな中、ある飲み会を早抜けしようとする清楚系女子・百合乃が気になり、後を追うべく店を出るユキ。しかしそれが、負けっぱなしの恋の沼の始まりだったのです"
  },
